Package: vabaxos-firewall
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: firewalld, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-nm-1.0, network-manager
Description: VabaxOS firewall, like the one of Windows
 firewalld with two kinds of network, as in Windows (ADR-0021): private
 (home, work), where devices, printers, shared folders and the phone are
 found, and public (café, hotel, train), where nothing comes in. Going out
 is always allowed. New networks are private; the VabaxOS setup and the
 command vabaxos-firewall change the kind of the network in use and allow
 file sharing, remote desktop or SSH in private networks.
